AArch64 LogRingReserve+unfixed-loadstore
"log ring (#613): two writers both reserve the same head sequence"
{
0:X1=head; 0:X4=0;
1:X1=head; 1:X4=0;
}
 P0           | P1           ;
 LDAR X4,[X1] | LDAR X4,[X1] ;
 ADD X2,X4,#1 | ADD X2,X4,#1 ;
 STLR X2,[X1] | STLR X2,[X1] ;
exists (0:X4=0 /\ 1:X4=0)
